.research/agents/tdense15_report.md:349:PROVED exact scope of this missing lemma: the displayed flat equation and two normalizations reconstruct a Boolean half-set. In fact h-inverse(0)=t and h-inverse(x)=+/-1/2 off zero; sum_x h-inverse(x)=h(0)=t forces equal numbers of the two signs off zero. Thus the fakes do not meet WRS's hypotheses. This is a precisely normalized form of QU(1+eta), not a claim to have bypassed P65's barrier by renaming it.
